-- Tests of ei6-part-8-6 (Act s 153.197, src:3088-3094). Expected values are read from the text by hand.

§ `Section 153.197 - weekly insurable earnings of at least $545`

#ASSERT `s 153.197 the floor of the weekly insurable earnings` EQUALS 545
-- the period in which the benefit period must begin: September 26, 2021 to November 20, 2021.
#ASSERT `the day` (YMD 2021 9 26) `falls within` `s 153.197 the period in which a benefit period must begin`
#ASSERT `the day` (YMD 2021 11 20) `falls within` `s 153.197 the period in which a benefit period must begin`
#ASSERT NOT (`the day` (YMD 2021 9 25) `falls within` `s 153.197 the period in which a benefit period must begin`)
#ASSERT NOT (`the day` (YMD 2021 11 21) `falls within` `s 153.197 the period in which a benefit period must begin`)
-- (1): the greater of earnings divided by weeks, and $545 (src:3088-3090).
#ASSERT `s 153.197(1) the weekly insurable earnings of the claimant are deemed to be` (YMD 2021 9 26) 6000 10 EQUALS JUST 600
#ASSERT `s 153.197(1) the weekly insurable earnings of the claimant are deemed to be` (YMD 2021 9 26) 5000 10 EQUALS JUST 545
#ASSERT `s 153.197(1) the weekly insurable earnings of the claimant are deemed to be` (YMD 2021 11 20) 5450 10 EQUALS JUST 545
#ASSERT `s 153.197(1) the weekly insurable earnings of the claimant are deemed to be` (YMD 2021 11 20) 5451 10 EQUALS JUST 545.1
#ASSERT `s 153.197(1) the weekly insurable earnings of the claimant are deemed to be` (YMD 2021 9 19) 6000 10 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 153.197(1) the weekly insurable earnings of the claimant are deemed to be` (YMD 2021 11 27) 6000 10 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 153.197(1) the weekly insurable earnings of the claimant are deemed to be` (YMD 2021 10 3) 6000 0 EQUALS NOTHING
-- (2): a self-employed person (src:3092).
#ASSERT `s 153.197(2) the result of dividing the aggregate by 52, for a self-employed person` (YMD 2021 10 3) 31200 EQUALS JUST 600
#ASSERT `s 153.197(2) the result of dividing the aggregate by 52, for a self-employed person` (YMD 2021 10 3) 28000 EQUALS JUST 545
#ASSERT `s 153.197(2) the result of dividing the aggregate by 52, for a self-employed person` (YMD 2021 10 3) 28340 EQUALS JUST 545
#ASSERT `s 153.197(2) the result of dividing the aggregate by 52, for a self-employed person` (YMD 2021 11 28) 31200 EQUALS NOTHING
-- (3): a fisher (src:3094).
#ASSERT `s 153.197(3) the weekly insurable earnings of the fisher are deemed to be` (YMD 2021 10 3) 700 EQUALS JUST 700
#ASSERT `s 153.197(3) the weekly insurable earnings of the fisher are deemed to be` (YMD 2021 10 3) 500 EQUALS JUST 545
#ASSERT `s 153.197(3) the weekly insurable earnings of the fisher are deemed to be` (YMD 2021 9 19) 500 EQUALS NOTHING
